\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Selection ratio trajectories for RGDS and External-only across eight generations. The dashed line marks the alignment threshold ($\text  {SR}=1.0$): above it, the selected subset is richer in rare n-grams than the rejected subset; below it, the reverse. RGDS's mean ratio declines from ${\sim }1.0$ to $0.64 \pm 0.20$, while External-only remains above~1.0 throughout. The large variance at Generation~7 reflects seed=456's late rebound (0.65$\to $0.87) without perplexity recovery.}}{8}{figure.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ratio_trajectory}{{2}{8}{Selection ratio trajectories for RGDS and External-only across eight generations. The dashed line marks the alignment threshold ($\text {SR}=1.0$): above it, the selected subset is richer in rare n-grams than the rejected subset; below it, the reverse. RGDS's mean ratio declines from ${\sim }1.0$ to $0.64 \pm 0.20$, while External-only remains above~1.0 throughout. The large variance at Generation~7 reflects seed=456's late rebound (0.65$\to $0.87) without perplexity recovery}{figure.caption.13}{}}
